# The extraction host's source is versioned here. Its SECRETS, STATE and DATA are not, and this
# file is the mechanism rather than care at commit time.
#
# The host holds ~44 GB of run artefacts next to these four files. Nothing in this list is
# reconstructable-but-large; it is all either a credential or a record of one run.

# Credentials. gpu-extractor.env carries a live DEMI_ADMIN_KEY (mode 600, inside a mode 700 /root).
*.env
*.env.*
!*.env.example

# Scratch copies that already differ from the deployed source — the reason this directory exists.
*.bak
*.pre-poolfix
*.orig

# Run state and output. progress.jsonl is 18 MB, ingest.jsonl 6 MB, reconcile-docs.json 17 MB.
*.jsonl
*.log
progress*.json
worklist.json
reconcile-*.json
purge-*.json
placeholder-only.json
false-failures.txt

# Extracted markdown, downloads, caches, and the point-in-time backups taken during re-runs.
sent/
out/
cache/
dead/
scratch/
*-backup/
false_failures/
retry_err/
stale_err/

# Python
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
